title: "Reject a transaction staged before a schema change"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Storage engine open
  s1: Transaction staged on current schema
  s2: Rows committed
  s3: Transaction holds prior schema
  s4: Stale transaction rejected
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: Stage row change
  s1 --> s2: Try commit
  s1 --> s3: Change table schema
  s3 --> s4: Try commit
